@startuml kairos-join-department-request-sequence
title Member Join Department Request

actor Member
participant "Member App" as MemberApp
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Member -> MemberApp: Open "Departments" on dashboard
MemberApp -> API: GET /departments/available?branchId=...
API -> DB: SELECT departments open for joining
DB --> API: List
API --> MemberApp: 200 OK {departments}

Member -> MemberApp: Choose department\nSubmit join form
MemberApp -> API: POST /departments/{id}/join
API -> DB: INSERT DepartmentMember\n(status="Pending" or "Active")
DB --> API: OK
API --> MemberApp: 201 Created

MemberApp --> Member: Show confirmation ("Your request has been sent")

@enduml
